      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6411766024104569524, guid: 1d20ccd84470b1347a1d3e08e42931bc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversation.Array.size
      value: 11
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6411766024104569524, guid: 1d20ccd84470b1347a1d3e08e42931bc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversation.Array.data[0].portrait
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ba32495fe0ef4ba479509a9d0de3ddf5, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 6411766024104569524, guid: 1d20ccd84470b1347a1d3e08e42931bc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversation.Array.data[0].sentence
      value: Tuan Puteri...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6411766024104569524, guid: 1d20ccd84470b1347a1d3e08e42931bc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversation.Array.data[1].portrait
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 2401671942302347048, guid: d197b0f092c974d4e884150e79a25ad3, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 6411766024104569524, guid: 1d20ccd84470b1347a1d3e08e42931bc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversation.Array.data[1].sentence
      value: Hang Tuah? What is wrong? You look like a ghost. Is this not where we
        part ways?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6411766024104569524, guid: 1d20ccd84470b1347a1d3e08e42931bc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversation.Array.data[2].portrait
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ba32495fe0ef4ba479509a9d0de3ddf5, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 6411766024104569524, guid: 1d20ccd84470b1347a1d3e08e42931bc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversation.Array.data[2].sentence
      value: I have betrayed you, Tuan Puteri. I have betrayed my honor. The words
        I spoke in Pahang... they were lies.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6411766024104569524, guid: 1d20ccd84470b1347a1d3e08e42931bc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversation.Array.data[3].portrait
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 2401671942302347048, guid: d197b0f092c974d4e884150e79a25ad3, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 6411766024104569524, guid: 1d20ccd84470b1347a1d3e08e42931bc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversation.Array.data[3].sentence
      value: Lies? I don't understand. The Sultan... he is not seeking a worthy Queen?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6411766024104569524, guid: 1d20ccd84470b1347a1d3e08e42931bc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversation.Array.data[4].portrait
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ba32495fe0ef4ba479509a9d0de3ddf5, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 6411766024104569524, guid: 1d20ccd84470b1347a1d3e08e42931bc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversation.Array.data[4].sentence
      value: The Sultan seeks to take you by any means. I was merely his loyal servant,
        tasked with the deceit.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6411766024104569524, guid: 1d20ccd84470b1347a1d3e08e42931bc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversation.Array.data[5].portrait
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 2401671942302347048, guid: d197b0f092c974d4e884150e79a25ad3, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 6411766024104569524, guid: 1d20ccd84470b1347a1d3e08e42931bc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversation.Array.data[5].sentence
      value: You used your good name to betray me? The legendary Hang Tuah?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6411766024104569524, guid: 1d20ccd84470b1347a1d3e08e42931bc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversation.Array.data[6].portrait
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ba32495fe0ef4ba479509a9d0de3ddf5, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 6411766024104569524, guid: 1d20ccd84470b1347a1d3e08e42931bc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversation.Array.data[6].sentence
      value: Yes. But standing here, on the edge of my kingdom, I realize my loyalty
        to The Sultan means nothing...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6411766024104569524, guid: 1d20ccd84470b1347a1d3e08e42931bc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversation.Array.data[7].portrait
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ba32495fe0ef4ba479509a9d0de3ddf5, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 6411766024104569524, guid: 1d20ccd84470b1347a1d3e08e42931bc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversation.Array.data[7].sentence
      value: if it destroys an innocent life. I will not complete this mission.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6411766024104569524, guid: 1d20ccd84470b1347a1d3e08e42931bc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversation.Array.data[8].portrait
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ba32495fe0ef4ba479509a9d0de3ddf5, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 6411766024104569524, guid: 1d20ccd84470b1347a1d3e08e42931bc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversation.Array.data[8].sentence
      value: We must turn back now. We must return to Pahang before the Malacca Guards
        arrive...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6411766024104569524, guid: 1d20ccd84470b1347a1d3e08e42931bc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversation.Array.data[9].portrait
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ba32495fe0ef4ba479509a9d0de3ddf5, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 6411766024104569524, guid: 1d20ccd84470b1347a1d3e08e42931bc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversation.Array.data[9].sentence
      value: They will come for us.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6411766024104569524, guid: 1d20ccd84470b1347a1d3e08e42931bc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversation.Array.data[10].portrait
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 2401671942302347048, guid: d197b0f092c974d4e884150e79a25ad3, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 6411766024104569524, guid: 1d20ccd84470b1347a1d3e08e42931bc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversation.Array.data[10].sentence
      value: If what you say is true, you have risked everything for my life. Then
        I will follow you again, Laksamana. Lead the way.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6411766024104569524, guid: 1d20ccd84470b1347a1d3e08e42931bc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversation.Array.data[11].portrait
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 2401671942302347048, guid: d197b0f092c974d4e884150e79a25ad3, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 6411766024104569524, guid: 1d20ccd84470b1347a1d3e08e42931bc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversation.Array.data[11].sentence
      value: If what you say is true, you have risked everything for my life. Then
        I will follow you again, Laksamana. Lead the way.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6411766024104569524, guid: 1d20ccd84470b1347a1d3e08e42931bc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversation.Array.data[12].portrait
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 2401671942302347048, guid: d197b0f092c974d4e884150e79a25ad3, type: 3}
